{"id": "bb4e8d36-6f42-51cd-96e9-774f324abc2c", "role": "civil-service-officer", "kind": "role", "difficulty": "hard", "category": "Situational judgement", "question": "An influential local person asks you to approve a file that does not meet the rules. What do you do?", "key_points": ["Refuses politely and explains which rule applies", "Records the request and the decision in writing", "Informs the senior officer", "Treats every applicant the same way"], "source_url": null, "sort_order": 11},
