ng they live", "Basic design: an API, a table from short code to long URL, a redirect", "How codes are made, random or encoded, and how clashes are avoided", "Growth: cache popular links, add read replicas, rate-limit"], "pool_id": "9088c46f-2f8f-5e5a-b09d-f531dc6918bd"}]},
