k", "key_points": ["Agrees a short daily overlap or a written update", "Writes questions and decisions in one shared place", "Plans work so you are not blocked waiting for answers", "Confirms requirements in writing before building"], "pool_id": "a8c57ff4-e5d6-5843-b7a7-9dc65876b174"}]},
