{"role": "full-stack-developer", "session_type": "technical", "difficulty": "easy", "questions": [{"question": "What is the difference between server-side rendering and client-side rendering?", "category": "Web basics", "key_points": ["Server-side: the server sends ready HTML, so the first view is fast and search engines read it", "Client-side: the browser builds the page with JavaScript after loading", "Many apps mix both", "Choose by speed on slow phones, search needs and the type of app"], "pool_id": "ea80a0be-d5a6-5414-b587-0408d1e5e850"}, {"question": "What is MVC, and how does a framework such as Laravel or Django use the idea?", "category": "Web basics", "key_points": ["Model: data and rules; view: what the user sees; controller: handles the request", "The framework routes a request to code that uses models and returns a view", "Keeps code organised and easier to test"], "pool_id": "c0e2439d-7e14-5be6-8992-7aa5319989eb"}, {"question": "What is REST, and how would you design the endpoints for a simple blog?", "category": "APIs", "key_points": ["Resources are nouns; actions are HTTP methods", "GET and POST on /posts; GET, PUT and DELETE on /posts/{id}", "Consistent JSON and correct status codes"], "pool_id": "e4a9724d-e685-58ce-bc0d-fb7796348ef2"}, {"question": "A small firm hosts its PHP site on shared cPanel hosting. How would you deploy an update safely?", "category": "Deployment", "key_points": ["Backs up the files and the database first", "Tests on a staging copy if possible", "Uploads with Git or SFTP, never by editing live files", "Runs migrations, clears caches and checks the site straight after"], "pool_id": "f14a8749-1079-5a90-98b3-eeecfad14b7b"}, {"question": "How do you protect a web form from SQL injection and cross-site scripting?", "category": "Sign-in and security", "key_points": ["Parameterised queries or the ORM, never SQL built from strings", "Validates input on the server", "Escapes output and uses the framework's templates", "CSRF tokens on forms and a content security policy"], "pool_id": "50b6e74d-8147-56f6-85b5-f09daac8a704"}]},
