rders, order items, payments", "Stores the price in the order item, because product prices change", "Payment status separate from delivery status, for cash on delivery and returns", "Indexes and foreign keys on the main lookups"], "pool_id": "28a9d42e-8956-5b73-bbd2-8b33144d6bb1"}]},
