", "category": "Leadership", "key_points": ["Listens first and learns from their experience", "Earns trust with small wins and by sharing the hard work", "Is clear about targets and fair to everyone", "Asks the manager for support only when it is really needed"], "pool_id": "44f1a8be-dee2-53d8-adf1-0388de8d4260"}]},
