s, and meet in private", "Listen for causes: skills, workload, health or personal problems", "Agree clear targets, support and a review date, in writing", "Follow the company process if it leads to warnings"], "pool_id": "0f695fbf-7efc-55b4-8b08-35f3626989f7"}]},
