still run out of money", "Simple example: sales on credit while suppliers want cash", "Show when money comes in and goes out, week by week", "Suggest actions: collect faster, plan payments, arrange short-term finance"], "pool_id": "0bbe9f52-a706-590a-b384-e84b612bfe74"}]},
