sing", "The choice depends on how the column is used and how much it matters", "Records the choice and shows its effect on the results"], "pool_id": "a1d66077-c766-5f78-b1b9-21c40407f626"}]},
{"role": "apparel-merchandiser", "session_type": "behavioural", "difficulty": "easy", "questions": [{"question": "Tell me about yourself.", "category": "Intro", "key_points": ["Present, then past, then why this role", "One real example that proves a strength", "Under two minutes, not your whole life story"], "pool_id": "e1b0dcf3-e7ff-570c-a0fb-56421f8c4672"}, {"question": "Why do you want this job, and why here?", "category": "Motivation", "key_points": ["Names something specific about this employer's work, from real research", "Links the role to your skills and what you want to learn", "Salary or 'any job will do' is not the main reason"], "pool_id": "50a78f3d-d069-517c-9e49-9332e5f74740"}, {"question": "What are you good at, and what are you working on?", "category": "Self-awareness", "key_points": ["One strength, with proof from a real example", "One real weakness, not a strength in disguise", "What you are doing about it now, and the progress so far"], "pool_id": "0ebf6fcd-96c9-51f0-a201-65cb54b61882"}, {"question": "Tell me about a time you disagreed with someone on a team. What happened in the end?", "category": "Conflict", "key_points": ["Sets the scene briefly: who, what and why you disagreed", "Shows you listened and argued with facts, not feelings", "Says what was decided, even if it was not your idea", "Ends with what you learned about working with people"], "pool_id": "e5e29a76-652f-5a74-8da5-e281b809f299"}, {"question": "Describe something you built or organised from nothing. What went wrong?", "category": "Ownership", "key_points": ["What you started, and why it was needed", "Your own actions, step by step, using 'I' and not only 'we'", "One thing that went wrong and how you fixed it", "The result, with a number if you have one"], "pool_id": "08842ffe-dce2-5d5a-8310-a2c70e5924f6"}]},
