tivity", "key_points": ["Check machine stops: yarn breaks, needle changes, waiting for yarn", "Check people: absence, skill, shift handover", "Compare by machine and by shift to find patterns", "Fix the biggest loss first and track the result"], "pool_id": "73ac8611-5b81-5cf3-a82e-1e90b02bcb3f"}]},
