wer analyser", "Check that the capacitor bank and its controller are working", "Add capacitance in steps, with detuned reactors if harmonics are high", "Check the result on the meter and the next bill"], "pool_id": "f63ded69-473a-5028-acd4-293cb82d37cf"}]},
